<title>USA: Genesis extends Imagex offer.</title>
<headline>Genesis extends Imagex offer.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genesis Insurance &amp; Financial Services Inc said on Wednesday it was extending for a second time its conversion offer to buy Imagex Services Inc shares.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement Imagex shareholders would receive one Genesis Insurance restricted share for every 6.25 Imagex shares converted.</p>
<p>Genesis, which said it aimed to own 66 percent of Imagex's outstanding shares, said it was extending the offer due to increased interest by Imagex shareholders.</p>
<p>The company said it owned over 51 percent of the outstanding shares.</p>
</text>
